meta {
  name: List My Apps
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-apps?page=1&page_size=20
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Dev-User-ID: {{devUserId}}
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  page_size: 20
}

docs {
  The app launcher: live deployments owned by the caller's own organisation,
  with a URL to open each one or a maintainer to ask. Open to every signed-in
  principal, whatever its roles.

  Validation / behaviour:
    1. Authentication required; no role gate.
    2. Scoped to the caller's organisation for every role, platform_admin included.
    3. Excludes deployments in state deleting or deleted, and soft-deleted rows.
    4. availability is available, degraded, preparing or unavailable; an unknown state reports unavailable.
    5. url is derived from values.ingress.host (https unless ingress.tls is false) and is present only
       when the host is a valid DNS name and availability is available or degraded.
    6. Never returns values, secret_refs, namespace, cluster_id or the raw state.
    7. Paginated, ordered created_at DESC.

  Responses:
    200 OK           — { items: [{ deployment_id, app_slug, display_name, categories, cluster_name?,
                         availability, access, url?, maintainer: { name?, email?, vendor_name?,
                         vendor_contact? } }], total, page, page_size }
    401 unauthorized — unauthenticated
}
